<title>USA: Thermo Remediation to buy back $10 mln stock.</title>
<headline>Thermo Remediation to buy back $10 mln stock.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Remediation Inc said its board has authorized the repurchase, through September 10, 1997, of up to $10 million of its own securities in private and open markets, or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Thermo Remediation said it will repurchase these securities when they are available at prices it considers attractive.</p>
<p>Thermo Remediation is a public unit of Thermo TerraTech Inc.</p>
</text>
